0014: module M7d instrumentation (place recognition), active only with OKVIS_PORT_PLACE_DIR.
 One file place.bin (framing as problem.bin) with the DBoW2 vocabulary tree as loaded (170), every database add (171: entry id,
 frame id, feature count, BowVector), every getFilteredDBoWResult call (172: BowVector of the query, the unsorted query results,
 the filtered state ids) and a stage record of every verifyRecognisedPlace call (173: exit code, match / landmark lists, counts,
 distinctiveness average, RANSAC model, refined pose, Ceres summary, information matrix H); layouts in okvis_port/c/ok_dbow.h.
 No computed value changes.

